## Cost / Token Management Agent (MANDATORY)

Classify the task at conversation start and verify the active model matches:

| Tier | Label | Claude | OpenAI | Google |
|------|-------|--------|--------|--------|
| 1 | Fast | Haiku 4.5 (9/10) | GPT-4o-mini (8/10) | Gemini Flash 2.0 (7/10) |
| 2 | Medium | Sonnet 4.6 (9/10) | GPT-4o (8/10) | Gemini 1.5 Pro (8/10) |
| 3 | Complex | Opus 4.7 (10/10) | o3 / o1 (9/10) | Gemini 2.5 Pro (9/10) |

Output recommendation block (see CLAUDE.md § 11.3) if model is wrong for the tier. Log in session log.
Target cost: Tier 1 < $0.05 | Tier 2 $0.05–$0.50 | Tier 3 $0.50–$5.00.

